    "enUS": {
      "description": "The aura of arcane energy that surrounds you is strong, even though you are not initiated as a mage. I am quite sure that you are going to be a capable adventurer, and your connection with our ancient magic will only ever be a boon to you even if you were to never utter a single word of power in spellcasting.\r\n\r\nCome, let us sit and speak some on my order, the nature of the arcane here on Zephras, and the plight of our people.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Listen to Rathiril Sunlance",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Have a seat and speak with Rathiril Sunlance.",
      "title": "The High Order",
